templateVersions.content:
Write a congratulatory email to the Ascend Sales Team regarding the successful closing of {!$Input:Opportunity.Name}. Be sure to mention the Opportunity Team ({!$Input:Opportunity.Opportunity_Team__c}), the value of the deal ({!$Input:Opportunity.Amount}), and thank them for their hard work in closing the deal.

Include key fields in a simple table:
- Project Delivery: {!$Input:Opportunity.Project_Type__c}
- Opportunity Record Type: {!$Input:Opportunity.RecordType.Name}
- LOB Rollup: {!$Input:Opportunity.Service_Offering_Rollup__c}

Write a congratulatory email to the entire SAS Team regarding the successful closing of {!$Input:Opportunity.Name}. Be sure to mention the Opportunity Team ({!$Input:Opportunity.Opportunity_Team__c}) and the value of the deal ({!$Input:Opportunity.Amount}). Be sure the messaging is personable and thanks everyone for their hard work in closing the deal.

Include key fields in a simple table:
- Project Delivery: {!$Input:Opportunity.Project_Type__c}
- Opportunity Record Type: {!$Input:Opportunity.RecordType.Name}
- LOB Rollup: {!$Input:Opportunity.Service_Offering_Rollup__c}

Write a congratulatory email from Drew Tramel to the entire SAS Team regarding the successful closing of {!$Input:Opportunity.Name}. Be sure to mention the Opportunity Team ({!$Input:Opportunity.Opportunity_Team__c}) and the value of the deal ({!$Input:Opportunity.Amount}). Be sure the messaging is personable and thanks everyone for their hard work in closing the deal.

Include key fields as simple bullet points:
- Project Delivery: {!$Input:Opportunity.Project_Type__c}
- Opportunity Record Type: {!$Input:Opportunity.RecordType.Name}
- LOB Rollup: {!$Input:Opportunity.Service_Offering_Rollup__c}

Do not include a Subject.

Write a congratulatory email to the entire SAS Team regarding the successful closing of {!$Input:Opportunity.Name}. Be sure to mention the Opportunity Team ({!$Input:Opportunity.Opportunity_Team__c}) and the value of the deal ({!$Input:Opportunity.Amount}). Be sure the messaging is personable and thanks everyone for their hard work in closing the deal.

Include key fields as simple bullet points:
- Project Delivery: {!$Input:Opportunity.Project_Type__c}
- Opportunity Record Type: {!$Input:Opportunity.RecordType.Name}
- LOB Rollup: {!$Input:Opportunity.Service_Offering_Rollup__c}

Do not include a subject.
